  "notes": "COMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {栽培|さいばい}する: to cultivate, to grow\n- {有機|ゆうき}{栽培|さいばい}: organic farming\n- {水耕|すいこう}{栽培|さいばい}: hydroponic cultivation\n- {露地|ろじ}{栽培|さいばい}: open-field cultivation\n- {栽培|さいばい}{方法|ほうほう}: cultivation method\n- {栽培|さいばい}{農家|のうか}: grower, cultivator\n\nUSAGE:\n{栽培|さいばい} is used for deliberate, managed growing of plants. It is not used for wild plants or natural growth. For animals, {飼育|しいく} (raising, breeding) is used instead.",
